#: contents/ui/ConfigGeneral.qml:187
#, kde-format
msgctxt "@info:usagetip"
msgid ""
"Look for a setting in <application>%1</application> to disable its tray icon "
"before doing it here. Some apps’ tray icons were not designed to be "
"disabled, and using this setting may cause them to behave unexpectedly."
"<nl/><nl/>Use this setting at your own risk, and do not report issues to "
"KDE or the app’s author."
msgstr ""
"請先在 <application>%1</application> 中查找禁用其托盤圖標的設置，然後再在此處"
"操作。某些應用程序的托盤圖標並未設計爲可禁用，使用此設置可能導致其行爲異常。"
"<nl/><nl/>使用此設置的風險由您自行承擔，請不要向 KDE 或應用程序作者報告相關問"
"題。"

#: contents/ui/ConfigGeneral.qml:190
#, kde-format
msgctxt "@action:button"
msgid "I understand the risks"
msgstr "我瞭解風險"

#: contents/ui/ConfigGeneral.qml:202
#, kde-format
msgctxt "@info:usagetip"
msgid ""
"Disabling the clipboard is not recommended, as it will cause copied data to "
"be lost when the application it was copied from is closed.<nl/><nl/>Only do "
"this if you’ve manually added a standalone Clipboard widget somewhere else, "
"or are using a 3rd-party clipboard manager. Also, instead consider "
"configuring the clipboard to not save history, or to only remember one "
"item at a time."
msgstr ""
"不建議禁用剪貼板，因爲這會導致複製的數據在源應用程序關閉時丟失。<nl/><nl/>僅"
"當您已在其他位置手動添加了獨立的剪貼板小組件，或正在使用第三方剪貼板管理器時"
"才這樣做。另外，也可以考慮將剪貼板配置爲不保存歷史記錄，或每次只記住一個項。"

#: contents/ui/ConfigGeneral.qml:211
#, kde-format
msgctxt "@info:usagetip"
msgid ""
"Disabling the Notifications widget is not recommended, as notifications sent "
"by apps will no longer be shown.<nl/><nl/>Only do this if you’ve manually "
"added a standalone Notifications widget somewhere else, or are intentionally "
"using a 3rd-party notification manager to handle notifications."
msgstr ""
"不建議禁用通知小組件，因爲應用程序發送的通知將不再顯示。<nl/><nl/>僅當您已在"
"其他位置手動添加了獨立的通知小組件，或有意使用第三方通知管理器來處理通知時才"
"這樣做。"

